        "text": "Page: Ben Stein. Sentence: He is most well-known on screen as the economics teacher in \"Ferris Bueller's Day Off\" (1986) and as Dr. Arthur Neuman in \"The Mask\" (1994) and \"Son of the Mask\" (2005).\nPage: The Mask (film). Sentence: The Mask is a 1994 American superhero fantasy comedy film directed by Charles Russell, produced by Bob Engelman, and written by Mike Werb, based on the comic series of the same name distributed by Dark Horse Comics.\nPage: America's Most Smartest Model. Sentence: The hosts were Ben Stein and Mary Alice Stephenson.",
